- Mr. President, I have
the honor to present

00:46:14.520 --> 00:46:17.990
candidates from Benjamin Franklin College

00:46:17.990 --> 00:46:21.701
for the Bachelor's
degrees of Yale College.

00:46:21.701 --> 00:46:24.730
When they have been
recommended by the faculty

00:46:24.730 --> 00:46:28.610
of Yale College and
approved by the corporation,

00:46:28.610 --> 00:46:32.260
Dean Chun will ask you
by your official act

00:46:32.260 --> 00:46:35.973
to confer upon them these degrees.

00:46:40.600 --> 00:46:44.500
By the authority vested in
me, I shall confer upon you

00:46:44.500 --> 00:46:46.900
the Bachelor's degrees in Yale College

00:46:46.900 --> 00:46:50.700
when designated by the Dean,
and shall then admit you

00:46:50.700 --> 00:46:53.973
